WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.756 --> 00:00:05.158
Bajie was in the cave when the door opened.

2
00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:19.584
Two small demons entered, dragging Wujing and the Tang Monk.

3
00:00:36.396 --> 00:00:36.796
"What happened?"

4
00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:38.418
cried Bajie after the demons left.

5
00:00:39.198 --> 00:00:41.840
"A demon attacked us," said Wujing.

6
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.743
"I tried to fight him, but he was too powerful."

7
00:00:44.763 --> 00:00:47.505
"I'm worried," said the Tang Monk.

8
00:00:47.525 --> 00:00:49.887
"We don't know what happened to Wukong."

9
00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:56.612
In another room inside the cave, Golden Horn talked to some smaller demons.

10
00:00:57.673 --> 00:01:02.657
They all laughed when Golden Horn told them Wukong was trapped under three mountains.

11
00:01:02.677 --> 00:01:04.959
"Let's celebrate!"

12
00:01:05.359 --> 00:01:06.220
said one demon.

13
00:01:07.704 --> 00:01:10.045
yet," said Golden Horn.

14
00:01:10.065 --> 00:01:14.167
"I'm afraid Sun Wukong might escape."

15
00:01:17.789 --> 00:01:20.010
He handed a gourd to one of the demons.

16
00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:23.631
"Take this magic gourd to the monkey.

17
00:01:25.112 --> 00:01:29.234
Say his name, and he will be sucked into the gourd.

18
00:01:30.254 --> 00:01:33.736
After an hour he will turn into liquid."

19
00:01:35.604 --> 00:01:38.625
"Yes, Master," said the small demon.

20
00:01:44.027 --> 00:01:46.188
Wukong pushed as hard as he could.

21
00:01:46.768 --> 00:01:48.488
But the mountains were too heavy.

22
00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:53.250
"How will I ever get out of this?"

23
00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:54.450
thought the monkey.

24
00:01:56.171 --> 00:01:59.512
He was about to push again when the mountains rose into the air.

25
00:02:03.316 --> 00:02:05.538
Wukong jumped to his feet and looked around.

26
00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:09.061
A spirit stood nearby.

27
00:02:11.262 --> 00:02:12.984
I am the spirit of these mountains.

28
00:02:13.784 --> 00:02:14.725
Please forgive me.

29
00:02:15.546 --> 00:02:20.490
I tried to stop that demon from taking my mountains, but he was too powerful."

30
00:02:25.374 --> 00:02:28.296
The spirit bowed and then vanished with the mountains.

31
00:02:30.298 --> 00:02:33.000
"I'm lucky that spirit arrived," said Wukong.

32
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.700
I must find my companions.

33
00:02:37.141 --> 00:02:38.661
I wonder where that demon lives."

34
00:02:48.524 --> 00:02:51.325
He spotted a small demon coming down the road.

35
00:02:52.565 --> 00:02:54.406
The demon was carrying a gourd.

36
00:02:56.086 --> 00:02:59.287
Wukong ducked behind a rock before the demon saw him.

37
00:02:59.307 --> 00:03:03.348
"Another demon," thought the monkey.

38
00:03:04.192 --> 00:03:06.754
"He probably knows the one who trapped me under the mountains."

39
00:03:07.915 --> 00:03:12.059
Wukong made himself look like a demon and stepped back onto the road.

40
00:03:16.422 --> 00:03:16.983
he called.

41
00:03:17.724 --> 00:03:18.704
"Where are you going?"

42
00:03:18.724 --> 00:03:24.689
"My master sent me to capture Sun Wukong," said the demon.

43
00:03:26.131 --> 00:03:27.091
Wukong laughed.

44
00:03:27.112 --> 00:03:30.374
"I know that monkey, and I don't like him at all.

45
00:03:31.175 --> 00:03:32.236
I'll help you capture him."

46
00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:35.237
you," said the demon.

47
00:03:35.257 --> 00:03:39.138
"But I can catch him myself quite easily."

48
00:03:41.258 --> 00:03:43.119
really?" asked Wukong.

49
00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:44.799
"How will you catch him?"

50
00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.820
demon showed Wukong his gourd.

51
00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:50.501
"This gourd is magical.

52
00:03:51.321 --> 00:03:53.662
It can hold a demon or a spirit.

53
00:03:54.602 --> 00:03:59.883
I just have to say 'Sun Wukong,' and he'll be sucked into it.

54
00:04:00.704 --> 00:04:03.457
After an hour he'll turn into liquid."

55
00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.541
Wukong laughed.

56
00:04:09.602 --> 00:04:10.743
"I have a better gourd."

57
00:04:12.784 --> 00:04:15.566
He quickly plucked a hair and turned it into a gourd.

58
00:04:18.088 --> 00:04:19.649
showed the gourd to the demon.

59
00:04:19.669 --> 00:04:22.051
"It can hold all of Heaven!"

60
00:04:23.272 --> 00:04:24.773
demon looked interested.

61
00:04:24.793 --> 00:04:29.896
"I wish I had your gourd."

62
00:04:30.817 --> 00:04:31.557
said Wukong.

63
00:04:31.577 --> 00:04:34.358
"I might be willing to trade gourds with you."

64
00:04:36.919 --> 00:04:39.300
The demon gave Wukong a suspicious look.

65
00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:42.362
"How do I know you're telling the truth?

66
00:04:43.662 --> 00:04:45.863
that your gourd can hold all of Heaven.

67
00:04:46.643 --> 00:04:47.944
Then we'll trade."

68
00:04:48.024 --> 00:04:51.266
"I'll prove it to you," said Wukong.

69
00:04:52.086 --> 00:04:56.468
The monkey recited a quick spell and left his body standing on the road.

70
00:04:57.836 --> 00:04:59.797
He flew fast up to Heaven.

71
00:04:59.817 --> 00:05:04.718
"I must make it look like Heaven got sucked into this gourd," he thought.

72
00:05:04.738 --> 00:05:09.039
"I'll ask the guard to close the gate and dim the stars.

73
00:05:10.339 --> 00:05:11.820
Then it will look like Heaven's gone."

74
00:05:17.621 --> 00:05:20.562
Wukong," said the guard at the southern gate of Heaven.

75
00:05:20.582 --> 00:05:25.263
"I need to pretend that Heaven has been sucked into a gourd," said Wukong.

76
00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:29.169
"When I say 'Heaven,' close the gate and dim the stars."

77
00:05:30.613 --> 00:05:31.656
The guard frowned.

78
00:05:31.676 --> 00:05:33.019
"I can't do that!"
